  values ('rule', $sod_lbl$👑 Access & Entitlement Foundation v6 — Number Visible, Depth Gated · המספר לא מוסתר, העומק כן$sod_lbl$, $sod_txt$[v6 · 10.11.2026 · ZURIEL (ד4): נוסף §19 «המספר לא מוסתר, העומק כן» — בדגם התצוגה של מספרי יסוד וישויות זהב (במיוחד 1820) מנוי פותח עומק ואינו מסתיר את המספר, הגימטריות והחתימות. מקור: number_page_law v1. ללא שינוי הרשאות (§21).]

[v4 · Human-Gate ZURIEL · 17.9.2026 — CAPABILITY PRESERVATION TREE · EXTEND_EXISTING]\n\nThis version preserves v3 in full and adds a forward product-planning invariant so approved capabilities do not disappear merely because they are not implemented yet.\n\n1. PRESERVE BY DEFAULT. Any capability explicitly approved by ZURIEL as desirable becomes part of the SOD1820 capability tree even if it is not yet implemented, priced, exposed or scheduled. Conversation-only approval is not enough long-term; the capability must be anchored in the canonical owner/tree.\n\n2. STATUS IS PLANNING, NOT AVAILABILITY. Every preserved capability may carry one planning state: NOW, NEXT, LATER, PARKED, CANCELLED, RETIRED. This status does not open the feature. Runtime availability remains owned by site_flags_lock_law. Entitlement remains owned by platform_tiers_law.\n\n3. ONLY EXPLICIT HUMAN-GATE REMOVES. A preserved capability may move to CANCELLED/RETIRED only after explicit ZURIEL decision. Lack of implementation, lack of pricing, low current priority, provider changes or temporary technical difficulty do not delete it. PARKED means remembered but intentionally inactive.\n\n4. ONE TREE / BOTTOM-UP. Build from foundations upward. Current dependency direction: Brand/Experience Context + Research/Truth/Access/Usage -> canonical engines (Gematria/Corpus/ELS) -> research projections -> Raziel -> Voice/Audio/Spatial/Media/Pulse/Cross-channel -> XR. Upper layers must consume lower owners rather than fork them.\n\n5. ELS IS EARLY FOUNDATION. ELS 2029 is prioritized as an early engine/projection foundation because later capabilities can consume it: ELS research -> spatial/3D ELS -> Raziel-in-ELS -> Raziel voice over ELS -> guided spatial research -> research-to-media. The new renderer may not fork the canonical ELS engine/corpus/coordinates/truth.\n\n6. FUTURE HOOKS/SLOTS. Canonical action surfaces should be able to expose semantic hooks such as listen, talk-to-Raziel, open-spatial, deep-research, create-brief, create-media, private-corpus, start-pulse. A hook may render BUILDING/COMING status without performing expensive I/O. No local hard-coded access truth.\n\n7. DO NOT FLOOD THE UI. A future capability may appear contextually where natural (for example Listen on Post, Spatial in ELS, Voice on Raziel), while a single central future/capability view may show the broader tree. The site must not become a wall of disabled buttons.\n\n8. CURRENT PRESERVED TREE. NOW: experience/capability infrastructure; ELS 2029 foundation. NEXT: ELS spatial/3D; Raziel inside ELS in text; Raziel Push-to-Talk and live voice foundation; Post Listen; Research Audio Briefing; Private Research Corpus. LATER: Research-to-Media; proactive Research Pulse; cross-channel companion continuity; guided high-end spatial research; XR/VR projection. These are priority buckets, not release promises; movement between NOW/NEXT/LATER/PARKED is allowed without deleting capability identity.\n\n9. DERIVATIVE IDEAS PRESERVED. Also preserved as first-class product concepts under existing capability families: Research Room (bounded long-running research dossier/workspace); Explain What I Am Looking At (Raziel explains current ELS/3D/UI selection/camera/context); Research Dossier (exportable structured record of methods, verified facts, interpretations, sources, Trace, media and spatial snapshots). These do not create new truth or owner systems.\n\n10. NO IDEA LOST BY DEFAULT. If an approved capability is deferred, it remains discoverable in governance/roadmap state and can be reactivated later. Defer != delete. Disable != cancel. Locked/building != rejected.\n\nOWNER CHECK: EXTEND_EXISTING platform_tiers_law + Experience/Raziel/ELS owners. No new product registry, entitlement engine, store, schema or pricing system is created by this version.

[v5 · Human-Gate ZURIEL · 24.9.2026 — RAZIEL GEMATRIA PREMIUM ANALYSIS · EXTEND_EXISTING]

11. CALCULATOR CORE != RAZIEL ANALYSIS. Calculator 2029 deterministic calculation remains a separate core capability. The capability “Ask Raziel to analyze this Gematria calculation/context” is explicitly PREMIUM-REQUIRED. Premium applies to the Raziel intelligence/deep-analysis capability, not to the truth or numeric correctness of the canonical Gematria engine.

12. CAPABILITY IDENTITY. Treat this as the existing Raziel/deep-research capability projected from a Gematria Calculation Selection (expression + method + result + provenance), not as a new AI engine, calculator tier system or calculator-specific Raziel persona. Conceptual capability key: raziel_gematria_analysis.

13. ZERO AI ON TYPING PATH. Typing/instant calculation MUST NOT trigger Raziel, LLM calls, deep search, World/Research scans or other expensive intelligence. The instant path remains deterministic/canonical calculation only. Cheap deterministic rendering/cached projection is allowed.

14. EXPLICIT INVOCATION. Raziel Gematria Analysis begins only after a stable Calculation Selection and an explicit user action such as “Ask Raziel”, “Analyze this”, or an equivalent deliberate deep-analysis action. Merely pausing typing, focusing an input or scrolling is not consent to start AI work.

15. SERVER-AUTHORITATIVE PREMIUM GATE. Before any model call, deep retrieval, tool/search chain or other expensive I/O for raziel_gematria_analysis, resolve availability + entitlement + budget on the server-authoritative access path. A locked/non-entitled UI may explain/tease the capability, but MUST NOT secretly execute AI/retrieval behind the lock.

16. PREMIUM CHANGES DEPTH/ACCESS, NOT TRUTH. Non-premium users may still receive canonical deterministic Gematria results and bounded deterministic explanation/Trace according to their separate access policy. Premium Raziel may synthesize, compare, search governed context and recommend next research actions, but may not invent Gematria values or upgrade interpretation into fact.

17. PERFORMANCE BUDGET. Calculator typing path permits only low-latency deterministic work. Selection may load bounded deterministic/DB context lazily. Raziel/LLM/deep research is L3 intelligence and explicit-action only. This is a performance invariant as well as an entitlement invariant.

18. PRICING NOT LOCKED. This decision locks PREMIUM-REQUIRED capability semantics only. It does not choose a plan name, monthly price, credit amount, token allowance or exact usage quota. Those remain future Human-Gate product decisions under this owner.

OWNER CHECK: EXTEND_EXISTING platform_tiers_law + raziel_companion_layer_law + experience_governance_foundation_v1_law + gematria_engine. No new entitlement engine, AI engine, calculator engine, store, schema or persona.

[v6 · Human-Gate ZURIEL · 10.11.2026 (ד4) — NUMBER VISIBLE, DEPTH GATED · carried from number_page_law v1 (14.6.2026) · EXTEND_EXISTING]

19. NUMBER VISIBLE, DEPTH GATED («המספר לא מוסתר, העומק כן»). Carried from number_page_law v1 within its original scope: the display model of foundation numbers and golden entities (especially 1820) and their number pages. A subscription never hides the number itself there: the number, its gematria values, its signatures and its basic DNA stay open to everyone, and the free layer may show a bounded sample of its matches. What a subscription opens is depth — for example advanced AI analysis, all graph paths, a personal message from the data, rare cross-references, unlimited journeys and depth reports. People do not pay to see the secret; they pay to go deeper into it.
20. CARRY-OVER BOUNDARY. Only the access principle of number_page_law v1 is carried, without widening it to other numbers or other gates. Its three-layer page composition, the layer-1 hints, the example quota (~20 of 250 matches) and the tier name are not carried: page composition belongs to the current Number/Experience owners; quotas, plan names and prices remain future Human-Gate product decisions (§18). The tier name «בני ההיכל» is not carried (ZURIEL 11.11.2026: the name will be replaced; the new name awaits a Human-Gate decision).
21. NO PERMISSION CHANGE. §§19–20 change no current permission, gate, flag or content lock; they state the invariant that the existing server-authoritative gates (§15) must keep.

OWNER CHECK: EXTEND_EXISTING platform_tiers_law. No new entitlement engine, store, tier or plan.$sod_txt$, $sod_meta${"build_direction": "bottom_up_one_tree", "compaction_v1": {"canonical_owner": "platform_tiers_law", "classification": "OWNER", "classified_at": "2026-09-15", "gate": "G2_CANONICAL_COMPACTION_ACTIVE_TREE_FREEZE_V1", "owner_family": "access_product"}, "els_dependency_chain": ["els_research", "els_spatial_3d", "raziel_in_els", "raziel_voice_over_els", "guided_spatial_research", "research_to_media"], "future_hooks": ["listen", "talk_to_raziel", "open_spatial", "deep_research", "create_brief", "create_media", "private_corpus", "start_pulse"], "g3_disposition_v1": {"classification": "KEEP_CANONICAL_OWNER", "classified_at": "2026-09-15", "gate": "G3_IMPLEMENTATION_COMPACTION_ARCHIVE_PASS", "no_automatic_runtime_inheritance": true, "normal_startup": true, "reason": "canonical owner survives into G3 unless explicitly superseded through owner gate"}, "human_gate": "ZURIEL 2026-09-17", "no_new_system": true, "owner_check": "EXTEND_EXISTING", "owner_routing": {"canonical_owner": "platform_tiers_law", "confidence": "high", "domain": "access_product", "normalized_at": "2026-09-15", "resolution": "RESOLVED_G2_COMPACTION"}, "planning_state_is_not_availability": true, "planning_states": ["NOW", "NEXT", "LATER", "PARKED", "CANCELLED", "RETIRED"], "preserve_by_default": true, "preserved_product_concepts": ["research_room", "explain_what_im_looking_at", "research_dossier"], "priority_tree": {"LATER": ["research_to_media", "proactive_research_pulse", "cross_channel_companion", "guided_high_end_spatial", "xr_vr_projection"], "NEXT": ["els_spatial_3d", "raziel_in_els_text", "raziel_push_to_talk", "raziel_live_voice_foundation", "post_listen", "research_audio_brief", "private_research_corpus"], "NOW": ["experience_capability_infrastructure", "els_2029_foundation"]}, "raziel_gematria_analysis": {"ai_on_typing_path": false, "capability_key": "raziel_gematria_analysis", "entitlement": "premium_required", "explicit_invocation_required": true, "human_gate": "ZURIEL 2026-09-24", "owner_check": "EXTEND_EXISTING", "pricing_locked": false, "server_gate_before_expensive_io": true}, "removal_requires_explicit_human_gate": true, "v6_number_visible_depth_gated": {"carried_from": "number_page_law v1 (2026-06-14)", "human_gate": "ZURIEL 2026-11-10 (ד4)", "no_new_system": true, "not_carried": ["three_layer_page_composition", "layer1_hints", "example_quota_20_of_250", "tier_name_bnei_haheichal"], "owner_check": "EXTEND_EXISTING", "permission_change": false, "principle": "המספר לא מוסתר, העומק כן", "scope": "original scope only: foundation numbers and golden entities (especially 1820) and their number pages"}}$sod_meta$::jsonb, true, 'platform_tiers_law', 6,
          v_base.depends_on, 5, v_base.weight, v_base.hebrew_date, v_base.axis_theme, v_base.gallery_id, v_base.identity_key)
  returning id into v_new_id;
  if (select md5(description) from public.nodes where id=v_new_id) <> '45b7856d096b2867aeb82061af3ef2f6' then
    raise exception 'S20 platform_tiers_law: new description md5 mismatch';
  end if;
  if (select count(*) from public.nodes where type='rule' and rule_id='platform_tiers_law' and is_active) <> 1 then
    raise exception 'S20 platform_tiers_law: active version count is not 1';
  end if;
end
